    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cOrganize and arrange the unique Tab\u00e9mons (*) at will and defend the hotpot from the onrushing enemies!\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0If the seal of the hotpot is broken, the world will be consumed by the spilled darkness and become a dark hotpot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0This is a tower defense food battle to save the world by defending the dark hotpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*) Tab\u00e9mons are strange creatures that look like food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/c7f7acddff3e7a5ea31b397a8dac01aa.poster.avif?t=1748180900\" width=800 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/c7f7acddff3e7a5ea31b397a8dac01aa.webm?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/c7f7acddff3e7a5ea31b397a8dac01aa.mp4?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Tab\u00e9mons guarding the hotpot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Tab\u00e9mons in the defense unit vary in personality and ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once deployed, they fight hard to protect the hotpot according to their own personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Form a formation that takes advantage of their individuality and use their unique skills to protect the hotpot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/0f9f04845ecef3b540cd3aac8042364d.avif?t=1748180900\" data-has-big width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The lands of hotpot defending, and enemy Tab\u00e9mons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The enemies who attack in search of the darkness of the hotpot are also unique Tab\u00e9mons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0In this game, fierce battles between Tab\u00e9mons take place in various lands of hotpot defending (stages).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/e13f331e415be30d5b4b7c4135b2aefb.poster.avif?t=1748180900\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/e13f331e415be30d5b4b7c4135b2aefb.webm?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/e13f331e415be30d5b4b7c4135b2aefb.mp4?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0And although they are formidable adversaries, they may join the ranks of hotpot defenders by fighting them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0As the game progresses, the range of Tab\u00e9mon compositions will expand, and you will be able to take on tougher stages!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/baf07a19783144975e97aae4a9dab5ee.poster.avif?t=1748180900\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/baf07a19783144975e97aae4a9dab5ee.webm?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/baf07a19783144975e97aae4a9dab5ee.mp4?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cOrganize and arrange the unique Tab\u00e9mons (*) at will and defend the hotpot from the onrushing enemies!\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0If the seal of the hotpot is broken, the world will be consumed by the spilled darkness and become a dark hotpot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0This is a tower defense food battle to save the world by defending the dark hotpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*) Tab\u00e9mons are strange creatures that look like food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/c7f7acddff3e7a5ea31b397a8dac01aa.poster.avif?t=1748180900\" width=800 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/c7f7acddff3e7a5ea31b397a8dac01aa.webm?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/c7f7acddff3e7a5ea31b397a8dac01aa.mp4?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Tab\u00e9mons guarding the hotpot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Tab\u00e9mons in the defense unit vary in personality and ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once deployed, they fight hard to protect the hotpot according to their own personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Form a formation that takes advantage of their individuality and use their unique skills to protect the hotpot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/0f9f04845ecef3b540cd3aac8042364d.avif?t=1748180900\" data-has-big width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The lands of hotpot defending, and enemy Tab\u00e9mons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The enemies who attack in search of the darkness of the hotpot are also unique Tab\u00e9mons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0In this game, fierce battles between Tab\u00e9mons take place in various lands of hotpot defending (stages).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/e13f331e415be30d5b4b7c4135b2aefb.poster.avif?t=1748180900\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/e13f331e415be30d5b4b7c4135b2aefb.webm?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/e13f331e415be30d5b4b7c4135b2aefb.mp4?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0And although they are formidable adversaries, they may join the ranks of hotpot defenders by fighting them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0As the game progresses, the range of Tab\u00e9mon compositions will expand, and you will be able to take on tougher stages!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/baf07a19783144975e97aae4a9dab5ee.poster.avif?t=1748180900\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/baf07a19783144975e97aae4a9dab5ee.webm?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/baf07a19783144975e97aae4a9dab5ee.mp4?t=1748180900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
